    "description": "Deterministic decision on n integers, three distinct positions. For every fixed k, input magnitude at most n^k. One fixed program for each k; correctness for every word width W >= b(floor(log2 n)+1). Signed fixed-width addition, subtraction, multiplication, indirect load/store and branch are unit-cost steps.",
